OL,3,GNEWSAClub cancels water activities due
OL,4,Ato E. coli spike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA club has cancelled its junior water
OL,7,Factivities this week after high levels
OL,8,Fof E. coli were recorded at a harbour.
OL,10,FSamples taken by Christchurch Harbour
OL,11,Fand Marine Society (CHAMS) found what
OL,12,Fit said were "alarmingly" high levels
OL,13,Fof e-coli in the River Stour.
OL,15,FAs a result, Christchurch Sailing Club
OL,16,Fhas cancelled its junior week, which it
OL,17,Fsaid had been a "heart-breaking
OL,18,Fdecision".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
