OL,3,GNEWSAClub cancels water activities due
OL,4,Ato E. coli spike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said it was
OL,7,F"out taking samples and checking the
OL,8,Fperformance of Wessex Water assets" and
OL,9,Fwas considering multiple sources of
OL,10,Fpollution, including agricultural and
OL,11,Fprivate sewage sources. Wessex Water
OL,12,Fsaid the reported pollution incident
OL,13,Fdid not relate to its assets.
